    "quick_access": {
      "value": "    \n🚀 Healthcare App Service Access\n================================\n    \n📱 Main Application:\n   Frontend: http://localhost:8082\n     (Container: nginx on port 80, Dev: React on port 3001)\n   Backend API: http://localhost:8083/api/\n     (Container: Node.js on port 5001)\n   Health Check: http://localhost:8083/api/health\n    \n📊 Monitoring Dashboards:\n   Grafana: http://localhost:3000\n   Prometheus: http://localhost:9090\n   Jaeger: http://localhost:16686\n    \n🔧 Management Commands:\n   Setup: ./access-services.sh setup\n   Stop: ./access-services.sh stop\n   Status: ./access-services.sh status\n   Restart: ./access-services.sh restart\n    \n📋 Kubernetes Commands:\n   View pods: kubectl get pods -n healthcare-staging\n   View logs: kubectl logs -n healthcare-staging -l app=healthcare-app\n   Restart: kubectl rollout restart -n healthcare-staging deployment/frontend\n    \n",
      "type": "string"
    },
